", "الآثار على السياسات العامة لـ سياسات صون التراث"),EnglishAdvancedWord("transnational perspectives on heritage preservation policy", "المنظورات العابرة للحدود حول سياسات صون التراث"),EnglishAdvancedWord("transparent disclosure of heritage preservation policy", "الإفصاح الشفاف عن سياسات صون التراث"),EnglishAdvancedWord("systemic vulnerabilities in heritage preservation policy", "الهشاشة البنيوية في سياسات صون التراث"),EnglishAdvancedWord("historical contingencies behind heritage preservation policy", "الظروف التاريخية التي شكلت سياسات صون التراث"),EnglishAdvancedWord("jurisdictional constraints affecting heritage preservation policy", "قيود الاختصاص التي تؤثر على سياسات صون التراث"),EnglishAdvancedWord("critical appraisal of heritage preservation policy", "التقييم التحليلي لـ سياسات صون التراث"),EnglishAdvancedWord("burden of justification for heritage preservation policy", "عبء التبرير لـ سياسات صون التراث"),EnglishAdvancedWord("competing narratives around heritage preservation policy", "السرديات المتنافسة بشأن سياسات صون التراث")],
      grammarTitle:"Hedging and evidential verbs",
      grammarArabic:"التحفظ العلمي وأفعال الاستدلال",
      grammarExamples:<String>["The findings appear to qualify earlier claims about heritage preservation policy.","Several documents suggest an alternative explanation of heritage preservation policy.","The evidence does not necessarily establish a causal link."],
      listening:"In a specialist seminar on heritage preservation policy, Hassan, the conservation architect, explained why an early institutional statement required reconsideration. A redevelopment plan promised jobs but threatened a centuries-old marketplace. Structural inspections revealed that several buildings could be restored. A second participant pointed out that apparently accurate documents still needed contextual interpretation. A developer called preservation prohibitively expensive while residents feared losing their livelihoods. The discussion turned from the search for a decisive slogan to the difficult work of comparing sources, exposing assumptions, and allowing relevant objections to be heard. Hassan proposed phased repairs with transparent funding and resident participation. The audience learned that a defensible judgment need not pretend to be infallible. The compromise preserved the streetscape without pretending that heritage had no economic costs. The final recommendation was therefore to distinguish verified observations from interpretive claims, document residual uncertainty, and make the reasoning accessible to those affected.",
      listeningQuestion:"What principle guided Hassan's response to the dispute?",
      listeningOptions:<String>["Publish the most dramatic interpretation immediately","Distinguish verified evidence from unresolved interpretations","Exclude every stakeholder who disagrees"],
      listeningAnswer:1,
      readingQuestion:"Why did Hassan resist an immediate definitive answer?",
      readingOptions:<String>["The inquiry did not have any participants","The decision had already been cancelled","The records, assumptions and competing claims required scrutiny"],
      readingAnswer:2,
      writingCue:"By the time the panel published its findings, the ____ was more measured than the original announcement.",
      writingAnswer:"qualified conclusion about heritage preservation policy"),
    EnglishAdvancedLesson(
      level:"C1",
      number:2,
      unitNumber:2,
      title:"The Whistleblower's Choice",
      titleArabic:"قرار كاشف المخالفات",
      storyTitle:"The Whistleblower's Choice",
      storyTitleArabic:"قرار كاشف المخالفات",
      paragraphs:<String>["At the regional transport authority, Amina, a compliance analyst, encountered a controversy that had already attracted confident public interpretations. Internal reports showed repeated safety inspections marked complete without visits. The evidentiary basis for whistleblower protection seemed persuasive at first, but the historical context of whistleblower protection complicated the accepted chronology. Rather than treating the interpretive framework for whistleblower protection as self-explanatory, Amina asked colleagues to identify the methodological assumptions behind whistleblower protection that informed the institution's language and decisions. The room fell silent when a familiar explanation suddenly appeared less secure.","Digital timestamps contradicted the official certification records. During a painstaking examination, the institutional response to whistleblower protection became as important as the object of the dispute. A detailed examination of the underlying controversy about whistleblower protection disclosed disagreements that the initial summary had disguised. The preliminary appraisal of whistleblower protection remained provisional until the team consulted the documentary record on whistleblower protection and reconstructed the sequence of decisions. What appeared to be a minor technical discrepancy now had implications for the entire inquiry, especially for those previously excluded from it.","Managers argued that disclosure would destroy public confidence in essential transport. The unresolved tension in whistleblower protection could not be settled by selecting whichever version sounded most reassuring. One participant emphasised the competing accounts of whistleblower protection, whereas another pointed to the ethical implications of whistleblower protection and demanded a more careful distinction between evidence, interpretation and preference. The discussion became uncomfortable precisely because the procedural safeguards for whistleblower protection required participants to defend the quality of their reasoning rather than the prestige of their institutions. Neither side could simply borrow authority from a title or a credential.","The following week, Amina convened an open session devoted to the public consultation on whistleblower protection and the regulatory constraints on whistleblower protection. Amina used the protected reporting channel and documented the risks carefully. The critical assessment of whistleblower protection was prepared in writing, with explicit references to what had been verified and what still required testing. During the deliberative process around whistleblower protection, participants were invited to reformulate objections without caricaturing their opponents. The aim was not superficial harmony; it was a decision whose limitations could be explained to a sceptical reader without embarrassment.","By the time the panel published its findings, the qualified conclusion about whistleblower protection was more measured than the original announcement. The long-term consequences of whistleblower protection could not be reduced to a triumphant headline, because the judgement imposed practical obligations as well as interpretive restraint. An external investigation distinguished substantiated misconduct from untested allegations. In her final remarks, Amina argued that intellectual credibility depends not on eliminating every uncertainty but on showing exactly how conclusions follow from the evidence offered. The story ended with a commitment to revisit the decision if new information emerged."],
      storyWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("evidentiary basis for whistleblower protection", "الأساس الإثباتي لـ حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("historical context of whistleblower protection", "السياق التاريخي لـ حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("interpretive framework for whistleblower protection", "الإطار التأويلي لـ حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("methodological assumptions behind whistleblower protection", "الافتراضات المنهجية وراء حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("institutional response to whistleblower protection", "الاستجابة المؤسسية لـ حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("underlying controversy about whistleblower protection", "الخلاف الجوهري حول حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("preliminary appraisal of whistleblower protection", "التقييم الأولي لـ حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("documentary record on whistleblower protection", "السجل الوثائقي لـ حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("unresolved tension in whistleblower protection", "التوتر غير المحسوم بشأن حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("competing accounts of whistleblower protection", "الروايات المتنافسة حول حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("ethical implications of whistleblower protection", "التبعات الأخلاقية لـ حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("procedural safeguards for whistleblower protection", "الضمانات الإجرائية لـ حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("public consultation on whistleblower protection", "التشاور العام بشأن حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("regulatory constraints on whistleblower protection", "القيود التنظيمية المفروضة على حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("critical assessment of whistleblower protection", "التقييم النقدي لـ حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("deliberative process around whistleblower protection", "عملية التداول حول حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("qualified conclusion about whistleblower protection", "الاستنتاج المتحفظ بشأن حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("long-term consequences of whistleblower protection", "التبعات بعيدة المدى لـ حماية المبلغين عن المخالفات")],
