ظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("long-term consequences of food system resilience", "التبعات بعيدة المدى لـ مرونة النظم الغذائية")],
      extraWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("epistemic ambiguity in food system resilience", "الغموض المعرفي في مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("rhetorical subtext of food system resilience", "الدلالة البلاغية الضمنية لـ مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("methodological integrity of food system resilience", "النزاهة المنهجية لـ مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("disciplinary disagreement over food system resilience", "الخلاف التخصصي حول مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("counterfactual scenario for food system resilience", "السيناريو المضاد للواقع بشأن مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("distributional trade-offs in food system resilience", "المفاضلات التوزيعية في مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("independently corroborated findings on food system resilience", "النتائج المؤيدة بشكل مستقل بشأن مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("normative presuppositions about food system resilience", "المسلمات المعيارية بشأن مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("interdisciplinary perspectives on food system resilience", "الرؤى متعددة التخصصات بشأن مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("institutional legitimacy in food system resilience", "المشروعية المؤسسية في مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("qualitative triangulation of food system resilience", "التثليث النوعي لـ مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("quantified uncertainty surrounding food system resilience", "عدم اليقين الكمي المحيط بـ مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("contextual evidence concerning food system resilience", "الأدلة السياقية الخاصة بـ مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("stakeholder engagement in food system resilience", "مشاركة أصحاب المصلحة في مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("independent audit of food system resilience", "المراجعة المستقلة لـ مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("policy implications of food system resilience", "الآثار على السياسات العامة لـ مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("transnational perspectives on food system resilience", "المنظورات العابرة للحدود حول مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("transparent disclosure of food system resilience", "الإفصاح الشفاف عن مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("systemic vulnerabilities in food system resilience", "الهشاشة البنيوية في مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("historical contingencies behind food system resilience", "الظروف التاريخية التي شكلت مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("jurisdictional constraints affecting food system resilience", "قيود الاختصاص التي تؤثر على مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("critical appraisal of food system resilience", "التقييم التحليلي لـ مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("burden of justification for food system resilience", "عبء التبرير لـ مرونة النظم الغذائية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("competing narratives around food system resilience", "السرديات المتنافسة بشأن مرونة النظم الغذائية")],
      grammarTitle:"Concession and counterargument",
      grammarArabic:"التنازل الحجاجي والمقابلة",
      grammarExamples:<String>["Although the evidence is incomplete, the question deserves attention.","Admittedly, food system resilience raises practical difficulties; nevertheless, consultation is essential.","While one explanation is plausible, another remains defensible."],
      listening:"In a specialist seminar on food system resilience, Dr. Bilal, the food systems researcher, explained why an early institutional statement required reconsideration. Repeated droughts exposed the fragility of a highly centralised supply chain. Farm records showed conflicting results for alternative crops. A second participant pointed out that apparently accurate documents still needed contextual interpretation. Retailers prioritised low prices while growers highlighted ecological costs. The discussion turned from the search for a decisive slogan to the difficult work of comparing sources, exposing assumptions, and allowing relevant objections to be heard. Bilal tested diversified procurement and fairer risk-sharing arrangements. The audience learned that a defensible judgment need not pretend to be infallible. The pilot demonstrated that resilience depended on institutions as well as technology. The final recommendation was therefore to distinguish verified observations from interpretive claims, document residual uncertainty, and make the reasoning accessible to those affected.",
      listeningQuestion:"What principle guided Dr. Bilal's response to the dispute?",
      listeningOptions:<String>["Publish the most dramatic interpretation immediately","Distinguish verified evidence from unresolved interpretations","Exclude every stakeholder who disagrees"],
      listeningAnswer:1,
      readingQuestion:"Why did Dr. Bilal resist an immediate definitive answer?",
      readingOptions:<String>["The inquiry did not have any participants","The decision had already been cancelled","The records, assumptions and competing claims required scrutiny"],
      readingAnswer:2,
      writingCue:"By the time the panel published its findings, the ____ was more measured than the original announcement.",
      writingAnswer:"qualified conclusion about food system resilience"),
    EnglishAdvancedLesson(
      level:"C1",
      number:3,
      unitNumber:3,
      title:"Public Narratives of Climate Change",
      titleArabic:"الخطاب العام حول تغير المناخ",
      storyTitle:"Public Narratives of Climate Change",
      storyTitleArabic:"الخطاب العام حول تغير المناخ",
      paragraphs:<String>["At the public media laboratory, Dr. Aya, a science communication researcher, encountered a controversy that had already attracted confident public interpretations. A documentary portrayed climate action as a choice between catastrophe and denial. The evidentiary basis for climate narrative framing seemed persuasive at first, but the historical context of climate narrative framing complicated the accepted chronology. Rather than treating the interpretive framework for climate narrative framing as self-explanatory, Dr. Aya asked colleagues to identify the methodological assumptions behind climate narrative framing that informed the institution's language and decisions. The room fell silent when a familiar explanation suddenly appeared less secure.","Audience research found that exaggerated certainty reduced trust among undecided viewers. During a painstaking examination, the institutional response to climate narrative framing became as important as the object of the dispute. A detailed examination of the underlying controversy about climate narrative framing disclosed disagreements that the initial summary had disguised. The preliminary appraisal of climate narrative framing remained provisional until the team consulted the documentary record on climate narrative framing and reconstructed the sequence of decisions. What appeared to be a minor technical discrepancy now had implications for the entire inquiry, especially for those previously excluded from it.","Producers wanted urgency while scientists asked for proportionate claims. The unresolved tension in climate narrative framing could not be settled by selecting whichever version sounded most reassuring. One participant emphasised the competing accounts of climate narrative framing, whereas another pointed to the ethical implications of climate narrative framing and demanded a more careful distinction between evidence, interpretation and preference. The discussion became uncomfortable precisely because the procedural safeguards for climate narrative framing required participants to defend the quality of their reasoning rather than the prestige of their institutions. Neither side could simply borrow authority from a title or a credential.","The following week, Dr. Aya convened an open session devoted to the public consultation on climate narrative framing and the regulatory constraints on climate narrative framing. Aya designed a narrative that joined credible data to locally relevant decisions. The critical assessment of climate narrative framing was prepared in writing, with explicit references to what had been verified and what still required testing. During the deliberative process around climate narrative framing, participants were invited to reformulate objections without caricaturing their opponents. The aim was not superficial harmony; it was a decision whose limitations could be explained to a sceptical reader without embarrassment.","By the time the panel published its findings, the qualified conclusion about climate narrative framing was more measured than the original announcement. The long-term consequences of climate narrative framing could not be reduced to a triumphant headline, because the judgement imposed practical obligations as well as interpretive restraint. The revised programme invited practical agency without concealing uncertainty. In her final remarks, Dr. Aya argued that intellectual credibility depends not on eliminating every uncertainty but on showing exactly how conclusions follow from the evidence offered. The story ended with a commitment to revisit the decision if new information emerged."],
      storyWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("evidentiary basis for climate narrative framing", "الأساس الإثباتي لـ تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("historical context of climate narrative framing", "السياق التاريخي لـ تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("interpretive framework for climate narrative framing", "الإطار التأويلي لـ تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("methodological assumptions behind climate narrative framing", "الافتراضات المنهجية وراء تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("institutional response to climate narrative framing", "الاستجابة المؤسسية لـ تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("underlying controversy about climate narrative framing", "الخلاف الجوهري حول تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("preliminary appraisal of climate narrative framing", "التقييم الأولي لـ تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("documentary record on climate narrative framing", "السجل الوثائقي لـ تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("unresolved tension in climate narrative framing", "التوتر غير المحسوم بشأن تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("competing accounts of climate narrative framing", "الروايات المتنافسة حول تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("ethical implications of climate narrative framing", "التبعات الأخلاقية لـ تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("procedural safeguards for climate narrative framing", "الضمانات الإجرائية لـ تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("public consultation on climate narrative framing", "التشاور العام بشأن تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("regulatory constraints on climate narrative framing", "القيود التنظيمية المفروضة على تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("critical assessment of climate narrative framing", "التقييم النقدي لـ تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("deliberative process around climate narrative framing", "عملية التداول حول تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("qualified conclusion about climate narrative framing", "الاستنتاج المتحفظ بشأن تأطير سرديات المناخ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("long-term consequences of climate narrative framing", "التبعات بعيدة المدى لـ تأطير سرديات المناخ")],
